                <p rendition="#center">[List of inclosures.]</p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>Resolution of the Senate of the United States, May 10, 1886.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>Resolution of the Senate of the United States, July 10, 1886.</item>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>List of vessels of the United States seized or detained since January 1,
                        1886.</item>
                    <label>4.</label>
                    <item>Text of the complaint filed by Her Britannic Majesty’s Government against
